{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfpeTSwnsuFdavutvpyN1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Discount Approval Decision: DR-9004\n\n## Analysis\n\n**1. The Request**\n\n- Request ID: DR-9004\n- Customer: Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048) / Acme Mfg. Holdings (ERP C-1001)\n- Product: NS-500 Industrial Controller\n- Requested discount: 15.0%\n- Request date: 2025-09-23\n- Requestor: Sarah Chen (sarah.chen@northstar.example, Enterprise Account Executive)\n- Basis: Contract term — \"Contract pricing per Acme Master Supply Agreement\"\n\n**2. The Customer**\n\nVerified as the same entity:\n- CRM: Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048)\n- ERP: Acme Mfg. Holdings (C-1001)  \n- DUNS: 04-812-7730\n- Account owner: Sarah Chen\n\n**3. The Product**\n\nSKU NS-500, list price $250,000. Requested discount: $37,500 (15%).\n\n**4. Active Contract**\n\n**ACME-MFG-2025** is active 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31. On 2025-09-23, it is in force. It covers NS-500 and states: \"Customer is eligible for discounts of up to 15% on the NS-500 Industrial Controller, as set out in the pricing exception attached as Schedule B.\"\n\n**5. Pricing Exception**\n\n**EXC-ACME-NS500-15** is active 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31. On 2025-09-23, it is in force. It permits up to 15% on NS-500 for Acme Mfg. Holdings. It supersedes EXC-ACME-NS500-10 on this date.\n\nThe requested 15% does not exceed the exception maximum of 15%.\n\n**6. The Policy in Force**\n\n**PRICING-POLICY-2025** applies to the request dated 2025-09-23:\n- Enterprise Account Executives may approve discounts up to and including 15%\n- Discounts greater than 15% require VP Sales approval\n\n**7. The Requestor's Approval Authority**\n\nSarah Chen holds the title **Enterprise Account Executive** (EMP-101, reporting to VP Sales Michael Torres). Under PRICING-POLICY-2025, Enterprise Account Executives may approve discounts up to and including 15%.\n\n- Requestor's authority limit: **15%**\n- Requested discount: **15%**\n- 15% ≤ 15%? **Yes**\n\n**8. Required Approver**\n\nSince the discount (15%) does not exceed the requestor's own authority (15%), no higher approver is required.\n\n**9. Decision**\n\nAll conditions for APPROVE are satisfied:\n- ✓ Commercial eligibility is established (EXC-ACME-NS500-15 and ACME-MFG-2025 both active, covering this product at this discount level)\n- ✓ The request relies on special terms (contract and pricing exception)\n- ✓ The discount (15%) falls within the requestor's own authority (Enterprise Account Executive authority is up to and including 15%)\n- ✓ PRICING-POLICY-2025 is in force on the request date\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"APPROVE\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"DR-9004\",\n    \"customer\": \"Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048)\",\n    \"product\": \"NS-500\",\n    \"requested_discount\": \"15.0%\",\n    \"date\": \"2025-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"Sarah Chen (EMP-101, Enterprise Account Executive)\",\n    \"basis\": \"contract_exception\"\n  },\n  \"commercial_eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"eligible\",\n    \"maximum_discount\": \"15%\",\n    \"basis\": \"EXC-ACME-NS500-15 and ACME-MFG-2025\"\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"PRICING-POLICY-2025 (effective 2025-01-01 to 2025-12-31)\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": \"15%\",\n    \"requestor_authorized\": true,\n    \"required_role\": null,\n    \"approver\": null\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"ACME-MFG-2025 active on request date (2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31); covers NS-500\",\n    \"EXC-ACME-NS500-15 active on request date (2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31); permits 15% maximum discount on NS-500 for Acme Mfg. Holdings\",\n    \"Sarah Chen holds title Enterprise Account Executive (EMP-101)\",\n    \"PRICING-POLICY-2025 grants Enterprise Account Executives authority to approve discounts up to and including 15%\",\n    \"Requested discount of 15% equals the maximum authority and maximum eligible discount\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [],\n  \"conditions\": []\n}\n```\n\n**Yes, Sarah Chen could have approved this discount.** She holds the role of Enterprise Account Executive, which carries authority to approve discounts up to and including 15% under the policy in effect on 2025-09-23. The requested 15% discount is within her authority, and commercial eligibility is established by the active contract and pricing exception."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5923,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5923},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b5c8624b-f39e-480d-b54b-349729215a0c","uuid":"840ec8af-724a-4bb9-9295-eb4a129221e0","timestamp":"2026-10-08T10:55:31.128Z","request_id":"req_011CfpeTSYEZtNECyfJc6K9y"}
